---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Card from '../components/Card.astro';import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';import {projects} from '../data/projects';import {url} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-top"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> SEO WRITER & CONTENT STRATEGIST</p><span class="tiny">WORDS WITH PURPOSE.</span></div><h1>讓品牌被搜尋，<br/>也被<span class="blue ink">真正讀懂。</span></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>我是 Connie，以旅宿餐飲的品牌經驗為底，<br class="desktop"/>寫出回應搜尋需求、也保有品牌溫度的內容。</p><a class="button" href={url('work/')}>探索精選作品 <span>↘</span></a></div><div class="hero-index"><span>SEO 文章撰寫</span><span>內容策略規劃</span><span>品牌行銷思維</span><span class="right">SCROLL TO EXPLORE ↓</span></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / SELECTED WORK</p><h2>文字背後，是對需求的理解。</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={url('work/')}>所有作品 ↗</a></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.slice(0,2).map(p=><Card project={p}/>)}</div><div class="editor-note"><span>THE EDITORIAL APPROACH</span><p>從「讀者為什麼搜尋」出發，<br/>到「品牌如何回答」，讓每一段內容都有方向。</p></div><div class="project-grid">{projects.slice(2).map(p=><Card project={p}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="about-strip"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h2>懂內容，<br/>也懂品牌的日常。</h2><a class="text-link" href={url('about/')}>認識 Connie ↗</a></div><div><p class="large-copy">七年以上旅宿與餐飲產業經驗，讓我習慣從真實的服務場景，找到值得被說清楚的品牌特色。</p><p>從品牌企劃、SEO 落地頁到節慶活動，將分散的資訊整理成易讀、有重點的內容。品牌行銷與 GA4 數據視角，則讓內容的討論不只停留在文字。</p><div class="skill-line">SEARCH INTENT <span>／</span> BRAND VOICE <span>／</span> CONTENT STRUCTURE</div></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">03 / HOW I CAN HELP</p><h2>從一篇文章，到完整的內容方向。</h2><div class="service-rows">{[['01','SEO 文章撰寫','回應搜尋意圖，建立清楚架構，讓讀者找到真正需要的資訊。'],['02','網站與品牌內容','將品牌特色、服務資訊與行動引導，整理成一致的網站語言。'],['03','內容策略與優化','盤點現有內容、規劃主題，讓下一步的內容更有依據。']].map(([n,t,d])=><a href={url('services/')}><span>{n}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>)}</div></section><CTA/></Layout>
